WEBVTT

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.050
<b>tsukinuketa aoi sora</b>

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.050
<b>The blue sky has broken through</b>

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.060
<b>saa dekakeyou</b>

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.060
<b>Come, let's go out</b>

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:28.890
<b>itsumo no namikimichi jitensha wo koideku</b>

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:28.890
<b>Riding my bike through the usual avenue</b>

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.570
<b>ima sugu ni aitai yo</b>

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.570
<b>"I want to meet you now."</b>

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.800
<b>omoi ga kaze wo kiri</b>

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.800
<b>That thought is blown away by the wind,</b>

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:44.790
<b>kimi e to hakondeku tegami ni natte</b>

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:44.790
<b>and becomes a letter being carried to you</b>

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:52.350
<b>koko kara hajimaru monogatari fly!</b>

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:52.350
<b>The story that starts from here... Fly!</b>

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:59.660
<b>kawariyuku kisetsu ga ashioto wo tatetemo</b>

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:59.660
<b>Even if the changing seasons walk on with loud footsteps,</b>

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:06.490
<b>sou kawaranai suki to iu tsubasa</b>

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:06.490
<b>the wings of love won't change</b>

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:14.500
<b>dokomade mo tondeke oozora takaku</b>

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:14.500
<b>Fly far away, high into the sky</b>

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:20.730
<b>koi no tenki yohou hare nochi hare ni nare</b>

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:20.730
<b>May the weather forecast of love be sunny and clear forever</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.400
<b>ashita mo asatte mo</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.400
<b>Tomorrow and the day after tomorrow</b>

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:35.990
<b>Episode 5    I don't like being alone</b>

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.550
The school's celebrity Yurie-sama's

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.120
Trouble Consultation has returned!

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:36.920
Is she free?

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.970
Yes! Go ahead, go ahead!

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:41.340
One coming your way!

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.780
The customers have been slowing down recently.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.060
I need to think of something.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.430
You all right?

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:51.640
Thank you—

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:53.760
I'm telling you it's a cold.

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:56.730
Possibly, but I'm alright.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:01.340
I'm sorry.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:07.990
There's this mean senior in my club—

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:16.280
She always hassles me about stuff, like my 
hair or what I have in my pocket, every day.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:19.150
She just takes advantage of being my senior.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:23.680
And I have to play doubles with her next game.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:26.930
Yurie!

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.330
What's wrong?

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:31.680
Yurie!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.290
The god died—

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:33.290
Yurie!

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.280
It's a cold.

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:39.220
She must have been really tired the last few days.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:42.220
No wonder she came down with a cold and fever.

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:46.480
I'll have someone from her home pick her up.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.640
You two can go back now.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:49.970
Okay.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.640
Can you bring her bag?

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:56.610
Yes.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:01.010
Well, she did say she was feeling a bit heavy today.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.280
If that was the case she should've told me so.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:06.940
I wouldn't have forced her to do it.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:07.970
Sure.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:11.750
What happened to Yurie?

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.100
Was it a curse?

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.230
A god sickness?

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:15.550
Nothing like that—

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.740
Just a regular cold.

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:19.630
She's going to leave early today.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:20.950
So that's what it was.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.380
Takano Chouei went back to Edo,

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:38.810
changed his name to Sawa 
Sanpaku and practiced as a doctor.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.340
On October 30, 1850—

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.900
Mom—

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:49.830
What is it?

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:53.500
What should I do about my bike—

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.750
I'll have Shou-chan bring it back.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.050
It's fine.

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.220
Don't worry and go to sleep.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:02.430
Okay.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:12.140
I wonder if she'll come tomorrow—

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.340
I don't know.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:17.110
I'm visiting her later to see how she is, how about you?

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:26.410
Well, she may have shaken it off by tomorrow.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.700
Shoukichi-kun, you're taking it home?

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.690
My mother told me to.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:36.540
It's embarrassing to ride a girl's bike though.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.360
I'll visit her later.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.480
But Yurie is asleep—

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.000
Her fever got worse after coming home.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.090
I see.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:51.130
In that case, could you hand 
her this final exam study guide?

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:51.960
Sure.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.020
Yurie's older brother?

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.690
It's her younger brother.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.070
He's more grown up than Yurie.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.140
Yurie is just too much like a kid.

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:03.990
Yeah—

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.470
So, how's Yurie?

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:08.270
She's sleeping upstairs.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:13.340
We got a shot for her fever from the doctor, though—

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.440
She's been really busy lately—

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:22.470
Martians, undersea and underground 
creatures, black hole creatures from the future.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.900
It was just too silly.

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:28.390
Anyway, just don't be too loud right now.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:30.850
I know.

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:32.890
Yurie-sama—

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.770
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.210
<i>She's stronger than she looks.</i>

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:47.140
At a time like this there must be something we can do.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:51.730
<i>Well, let's pray to the god of health.</i>

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.720
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:59.820
That god gave me the cold shoulder a while back—

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.880
She said I looked too seedy.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.370
It's still not going down—

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.490
Let's take today off, too.

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:21.450
I'll call your school.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.060
Mom—

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:24.780
What is it?

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.780
I want some pudding.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:28.480
Okay.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.240
I'll go buy some.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:42.080
Sometimes, having a cold can be nice as well.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.210
Be careful saying that!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:47.190
You might get divine punishment for it, Yurie-sama.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.680
Can a god receive divine punishment?

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:52.930
That's kinda strange—

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:57.500
What's that?

00:06:58.070 --> 00:06:59.210
Sorry.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:02.100
It looks like a handout from school.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:04.140
Someone came?

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:05.500
Mitsue-chan?

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:09.460
No, Shoukichi-san brought it with him—

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:11.660
I see.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.190
<i>Yurie-chan!</i>

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.380
<i>Don't talk too much.</i>

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:18.660
<i>It's better to rest.</i>

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.560
Yeah, I guess you're right.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:00.360
I slept pretty long.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.910
It's only 10:30.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:20.330
I wonder what everyone's doing right now—

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.890
Are they worried about me?

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:32.490
Maybe Yurie is even sicker than we thought.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:36.160
Well— summer colds are the worst.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.310
Are you worried?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.640
Well, yeah.

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:45.930
After all, I'm her manager.

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.820
I have a responsibility towards my big talent's health.

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:50.090
"Talent", eh?

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.070
Aren't you missing someone?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.090
Ken-chan!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.400
Yurie is taking today off.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.600
Hitotsubashi-san?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.620
With hair in the front like this—

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:04.100
and tiny?

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:07.570
Why's she out?

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:10.730
Ken-chan, were you not listening this morning?

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.020
She's sick.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:12.970
Oh.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.530
She's sick.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.250
If Yurie heard that, she'd cry.

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:22.050
Actually for Ken-chan that's progress.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.280
What's wrong?

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.070
Something bothering you?

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.760
No, not really—

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:31.860
I wonder what it is—

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.160
Should we tell Yurie?

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:37.800
I don't know if this is progress or not.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.470
Now, take a good look at the microbes!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.660
Saegusa-san?

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.270
See, parameciums are actually kind of cute!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.450
No, they're not cute at all!

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:47.820
Yes?

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:51.200
What kind of charm helps protect against sickness?

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:53.110
Sound Health.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:58.890
Today—

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:03.730
I'd like to buy one, does Raifuku Shrine have them?

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:04.560
Yes.

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:06.830
For Yurie-san?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.560
How'd you know?

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.270
My sister told me.

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:15.580
You're actually very kind, aren't you, Hitotsubashi-kun.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.670
I wonder if my cold got worse—

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:36.750
I bet everyone is talking about me—

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.660
Yurie-sama!

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.770
What is it?

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:52.040
We heard you were sick, so we thought we'd flutter by!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.940
So now we've rushed in like a roar!

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:57.010
Dear me, I couldn't help myself!

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:01.400
Forgive me, poverty god!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.550
Are you feeling well?

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.430
Sorry.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.920
Don't worry about it.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.410
I still have a fever.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:09.830
I'm sorry, I can't take any wishes right now.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:11.430
That's not a problem!

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:16.510
Right now we are declining all requests, 
so please take your time and get better!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:22.800
We will aid you with legal problems, property 
issues and inheritance so do not worry!

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:26.740
That's a lot of pressure—

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:37.570
Here.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.630
Say hello to Yurie-san.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:52.290
Hey—

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:00.250
Wait up!

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.480
Maybe you're getting fat.

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.050
You don't get enough exercise!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.720
What're you doing here?

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:09.860
Er—

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:14.170
Hitotsubashi-kun wanted a get-well charm for Yurie-san.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:15.670
Thanks.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.190
No problem.

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.050
She was out today as well, right?

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.150
I hope she's okay.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:21.610
She's fine.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.390
It's just a normal fever.

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:25.540
Yurie-sama is sick?

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:26.770
Yashima-sama!

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.330
I'm home.

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.280
Well, that explains it.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:37.290
I thought the spirits were unusually quiet.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:39.080
Has something changed?

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:41.060
I can't tell at all—

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.260
In our world, nothing really.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:48.260
However, in the spirit world, everyone 
has been somewhat subdued.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:51.230
Is that because of Yurie-san?

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:53.180
Because of her—

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:57.590
Well, Yurie-sama is popular in a weird way.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:01.230
Well, nothing at school seems to have changed.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:08.390
To regular people, that's all a god is.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.220
When they're in trouble

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.600
they'll ask for something, but 
they are not constantly worried

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.500
whether or not the gods are around.

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:19.530
Yeah.

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:23.630
When Yashima-sama was missing 
from our shrine, we couldn't tell at all.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.000
Yashima-sama—

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:40.400
But you know—

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:45.380
I think that Yurie is a little different.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:49.200
She's a god, but she's also a middle schooler.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:52.800
It's not like no one would care if she disappeared.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:58.010
I hope she gets better soon.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:01.760
Yeah.

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:17.700
Get better soon, stupid.

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:21.250
Become Well

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:27.960
I don't know—

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.550
She might be a little hot.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:36.560
Just to be careful, you should take one more day off.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:40.090
The most dangerous time when you 
have a cold is when you're recovering.

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:44.250
We should listen to Kenkichi-san.

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:49.560
Just today, you should rest.

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:51.720
I'm almost all better though—

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:56.060
Almost means you're not completely better.

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.630
Be a good girl, now.

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:14.260
I wonder what everyone is doing—

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:20.480
I haven't gotten any visits while I've been sick—

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.530
Maybe they don't like me.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:27.660
Of course they do.

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:30.090
Please cheer up Yurie-sama.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.890
Well, I'm still sick.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:36.100
Sorry.

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:39.660
But, it seems like everyone is being cold.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:43.440
Maybe I'll just sleep like this until summer break.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:45.090
<i>What are you saying!?</i>

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.650
<i>That's giving up to complete lethargy.</i>

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:50.050
I'm kidding.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.390
<i>No!</i>

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:55.360
<i>Yurie-chan, you aren't grateful 
for how much you really have.</i>

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:59.490
<i>I've gone to the border of life and death, so I'd know—</i>

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.000
<i>Yurie-chan?</i>

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:09.620
Y-Y-Yurie-sama!

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:10.440
What?

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:26.650
Maybe the get-well charm did this—

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:28.150
Maybe—

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:35.660
Might be useful!

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:38.370
I'm going outside for a second!

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.410
Wait, that's—

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.550
See you later!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.100
Yurie-sama!

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.380
<i>She gets so carried away!</i>

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:52.960
Mom.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.640
Mom!

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:02.040
I guess she can't see me after all.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.660
It's like I'm a ghost!

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:19.930
I wonder what they call the ghost of a god!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:30.210
I'm sorry.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:50.260
This is so beautiful!

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:32.710
Ouch—

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.820
It doesn't hurt, though.

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:36.300
Hm?

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.620
Yurie-sama?

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:42.200
It's been a while, have you got a job as a ghost now?

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:44.730
No, it's not like that—

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:49.690
Yurie-sama, being a god suits you better, after all.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:51.710
Thank you.

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:56.170
You should quit middle school and devote 
yourself to becoming a full-time god!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:57.890
Farewell!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.230
Mitsue-chan!

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:12.520
Matsuri-chan!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.110
Mitsue-chan!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.140
They really can't see me—

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:40.820
Sign: Calligraphy Club

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:40.940
Become Well

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:49.120
I want to get better soon—

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.880
It seems like she's almost recovered fully.

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:03.820
Oh!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:04.990
You're awake?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.520
Perfect!

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:07.820
Hey.

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:10.770
Mitsue-chan!

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:13.270
How are you feeling?

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.730
Matsuri-chan, too!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.950
Then, you'll be okay tomorrow?

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:21.830
Probably.

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:24.540
Sorry for making you all worry.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:26.340
We're not really that worried.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:30.780
We even made get-well charms yesterday.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:34.870
Well, getting better is the most important thing.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.120
You can have some if you want.

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:37.760
Thank you!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:39.270
What is it?

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:43.900
It's a Raifuku Shrine specialty:

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.420
A wonder drug for colds!

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:47.290
Imori Gold Strawberry Flavor!

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:49.210
Who cares about the flavor?!

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:50.710
Don't hold back, go at it!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.590
I'm going to hold back.

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:54.690
I'm almost better!

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:57.250
Then, I guess you won't need this either.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.290
It's such a waste, Ken-chan gave it to us—

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:01.380
Ninomiya-kun did?

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:04.740
Sign: Sound Health

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:08.900
Ninomiya-kun wrote it?

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:13.760
He doesn't know why, but he said that 
he thought of your face when writing.

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:14.630
It's progress!

00:22:25.270 --> 00:22:26.680
Here, open wide!

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:37.020
Great, Yurie!

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:38.680
Here's your reward!

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:45.870
Are you okay?

00:22:45.870 --> 00:22:47.760
I'm not okay!

00:22:47.120 --> 00:22:51.180
She's fine, it really works! C'mon, chew chew!

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:01.470
Morning.

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:02.440
Good morning!

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:04.510
You were sick?

00:23:04.510 --> 00:23:06.260
Are you feeling better now?

00:23:06.260 --> 00:23:06.860
Yeah!

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:09.350
I'm feeling great now!

00:23:09.350 --> 00:23:11.620
But you didn't have to come back so soon—

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:14.590
Really, you could've rested 
two more days if you wanted.

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:16.850
I'm bummed out.

00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:18.410
I'm no good at modern Japanese.

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:22.320
Your face is red! Are you still sick?

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:25.160
No, I'm fine!

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:26.860
That's the spirit.

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:30.820
You're just recovering but 
let's try our hardest for finals!

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:32.220
For finals?

00:23:32.610 --> 00:23:34.640
I gave you the handout, right?

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.760
I got them— but I forgot—

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:42.480
Wait!

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:45.750
Good morning.

00:23:46.430 --> 00:23:47.350
Good morning!

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:49.740
What's wrong?

00:23:50.140 --> 00:23:51.740
I'm leaving early!

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:53.610
Another cold?

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:58.200
Then, can I try the papaya 
flavored Imori Gold on you today?

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:00.660
"Try it on her"?

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:11.040
Certainly, Yurie-sama might become 
a slightly different kind of god.

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:17.580
Yurie-sama, Rest well and eat a lot!

00:24:21.230 --> 00:24:27.300
<b>mada mada zenzen owannai last ichijikan no jugyou desu</b>

00:24:21.230 --> 00:24:27.300
<b>The last class of the day never seems to end</b>

00:24:27.300 --> 00:24:32.180
<b>tokei wo chira chira mitemo ichi byou ga nagai ne</b>

00:24:27.300 --> 00:24:32.180
<b>Even if I keep glancing at my watch, a second seems an eternity</b>

00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:39.250
<b>mabushii koutei mieru kimi no hashiru sugata oikake</b>

00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:39.250
<b>In the radiant schoolyard, trailing your running visage,</b>

00:24:39.250 --> 00:24:44.390
<b>houkago love-love date mousou shite bosou chuu</b>

00:24:39.250 --> 00:24:44.390
<b>my imagination is running wild about our date after class</b>

00:24:45.280 --> 00:24:48.300
<b>chime no kane koi no signal</b>

00:24:45.280 --> 00:24:48.300
<b>The school chimes ring and it's a signal of love!</b>

00:24:48.300 --> 00:24:51.290
<b>rouka no tobidashi ni wa chuui</b>

00:24:48.300 --> 00:24:51.290
<b>Be careful if you rush out into the hallway!</b>

00:24:51.290 --> 00:24:54.270
<b>kimi no moto e ichiban saki ni</b>

00:24:51.290 --> 00:24:54.270
<b>I dash to see you, first thing!</b>

00:24:54.270 --> 00:24:56.880
<b>issho ni kaerou</b>

00:24:54.270 --> 00:24:56.880
<b>Let's go home together!</b>

00:24:57.860 --> 00:25:04.520
<b>soda aji no ice candy gira gira na ohisama no shita hanbunko</b>

00:24:57.860 --> 00:25:04.520
<b>Sharing a soda-flavored popsicle under the glaring sun</b>

00:25:04.520 --> 00:25:10.560
<b>torokesou na atashi no seishun desu doki doki shichau</b>

00:25:04.520 --> 00:25:10.560
<b>My youth seems to melt with it, it makes my heart beat faster</b>

00:25:10.560 --> 00:25:16.030
<b>kono nanigenai toki wo ima mune ni shimatte</b>

00:25:10.560 --> 00:25:16.030
<b>I'm shutting our casual time in my heart</b>

00:25:16.330 --> 00:25:23.450
<b>asu wa mata kyou yori mo kimi wo suki ni naru no desu</b>

00:25:16.330 --> 00:25:23.450
<b>Tomorrow I will love you even more than today</b>

00:25:27.650 --> 00:25:42.640
<b>Preview</b>

00:25:28.020 --> 00:25:29.780
There are no rules in love!

00:25:30.120 --> 00:25:32.580
No gods or seniors either!

00:25:33.150 --> 00:25:35.120
So, you can use any means!

00:25:36.130 --> 00:25:38.650
Next time, A Tiny Resolution.

00:25:37.550 --> 00:25:42.640
<b>A Tiny Resolution</b>

00:25:39.160 --> 00:25:41.680
For tomorrow, chuchuchuu!
